    "result_text": "All 268 tests pass, including the new `Cp08Tests` and the full existing suite (owner controllers, JDBC/JPA repositories across all DB profiles).\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the registration-date default for owner creation:\n\n- **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added a persisted `LocalDate registrationDate` field (`registration_date` column) with getter/setter.\n- **`BuildOwner.java`** \u2014 when building a new owner from the request, defaults `registrationDate` to `LocalDate.now()` if none is supplied.\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `registrationDate` property (`type: string, format: date, readOnly`) to the `Owner` response schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries it and MapStruct maps it automatically. Jackson serializes `LocalDate` as ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`.\n- **`db/{hsqldb,h2,mysql,postgres}/schema.sql`** \u2014 added the nullable `registration_date DATE` column so the field persists across the create \u2192 GET round-trip.\n\nThe response now returns `registrationDate` in ISO format, defaulting to today's date when the owner is created without one.",
